      "text": "```\nWHO STRUCTURE:\n  World Health Assembly (WHA):\n    194 member states, meets annually (Geneva, May)\n    Sets policy, approves budget, elects Director-General\n    Each member state = 1 vote (regardless of size/GDP)"
