      "text": "## Measuring Global Health Burden — DALY Methodology"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#010",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nDALY = DISABILITY-ADJUSTED LIFE YEAR\n  One DALY = one year of healthy life lost\n  DALYs = YLL + YLD"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#011",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "YLL (Years of Life Lost due to premature mortality):\n    YLL = N × L\n    where N = number of deaths, L = expected years lost\n    L = life expectancy at age of death (GBD uses standard life table)\n    Standard life expectancy: 88.9 years for females (Japan reference)\n    Male/female unified standard: 88.9 years for both (GBD 2010+)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#012",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Example: Death at age 30 → L ≈ 58.9 years\n    YLL = 1 × 58.9 = 58.9 DALYs"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#013",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "YLD (Years Lived with Disability):\n    YLD = P × DW × L\n    where P = prevalent cases, DW = disability weight (0-1), L = duration\n    DW ranges from ~0 (near-perfect health) to 1 (death)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#014",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Disability weights from multi-country surveys:\n    Mild hearing loss: ~0.01\n    Moderate depression: ~0.16\n    Severe stroke (long-term consequences): ~0.32\n    Dementia (moderate): ~0.38\n    AIDS (before ART): ~0.582"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#015",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DW IS A UTILITY FUNCTION over health states.\n    0 = perfect health, 1 = death. Additive.\n    Connection to decision theory: DW is a health utility;\n    DALY calculation is expected disutility."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#016",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BURDEN COMPARISON:\n    Global DALYs (2019): ~2.5 billion\n    Top causes:\n    1. Neonatal disorders:        195M DALYs\n    2. Ischemic heart disease:    182M\n    3. Stroke:                     143M\n    4. Lower respiratory infections: 137M\n    5. Diabetes:                   110M\n    6. COPD:                       104M\n    7. Depression (unipolar):      103M\n    8. Lower back pain:            83M"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md#017",
      "path": [
        "07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:public-health:07-global-health, git-history:public-health:07-global-health]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "concepts": "[global, health]",
        "current_path": "public-health/07-GLOBAL-HEALTH.md",
        "id": "maxim:public-health:global-health",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "public-health",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[global, health]",
        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Global Health",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Note: Depression and back pain are huge burden despite low mortality.\n  DALY captures morbidity that mortality-based measures miss entirely.\n```"
    },
